### Shopper flow (anonymous). Replace "acme" with your store handle; variantId from the catalog.

@base = http://localhost:8080
@host = acme.storeforge.localhost
@variantId = PASTE_VARIANT_ID

### 1. Create a cart (the token is returned only once)
POST {{base}}/storefront/v1/carts
X-Forwarded-Host: {{host}}

> {% client.global.set("cartId", response.body.cartId); client.global.set("cartToken", response.body.cartToken); %}

### 2. Add an item
POST {{base}}/storefront/v1/carts/{{cartId}}/items
X-Forwarded-Host: {{host}}
X-Cart-Token: {{cartToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"variantId": "{{variantId}}", "quantity": 2}

### 3. Start checkout
POST {{base}}/storefront/v1/checkouts
X-Forwarded-Host: {{host}}
X-Cart-Token: {{cartToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"cartId": "{{cartId}}", "email": "buyer@example.test",
 "shippingAddress": {"name": "Ada Lovelace", "line1": "1 Main St", "city": "Paris", "postalCode": "75001", "country": "FR"}}

> {% client.global.set("checkoutId", response.body.id); client.global.set("total", response.body.total.amount);
     if (response.body.shippingRates.length > 0) client.global.set("rateId", response.body.shippingRates[0].id); %}

### 3a. Apply a discount code (P13; create one with http/commerce.http). "applicable" + "reason" explain the result
PUT {{base}}/storefront/v1/checkouts/{{checkoutId}}/discount
X-Forwarded-Host: {{host}}
X-Cart-Token: {{cartToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "welcome10"}

> {% client.global.set("total", response.body.total.amount); %}

### 3b. Choose a shipping rate (P13; required when the store has rates). Free shipping is judged after the discount
PUT {{base}}/storefront/v1/checkouts/{{checkoutId}}/shipping-rate
X-Forwarded-Host: {{host}}
X-Cart-Token: {{cartToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rateId": "{{rateId}}"}

> {% client.global.set("total", response.body.total.amount); %}

### 4. Complete (send it twice with the same key: the second is a replay)
POST {{base}}/storefront/v1/checkouts/{{checkoutId}}/completion
X-Forwarded-Host: {{host}}
X-Cart-Token: {{cartToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 6c1a9f3e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedTotal": "{{total}}"}


### Search (P13): words, accents ignored, typos in titles tolerated; filters, sort, facets
GET {{base}}/storefront/v1/search?q=lampshde&maxPrice=100&sort=relevance&limit=10
X-Forwarded-Host: {{host}}

### Browse with a vendor filter (facets still list the other vendors)
GET {{base}}/storefront/v1/search?vendor=Acme&sort=price_asc
X-Forwarded-Host: {{host}}
